# The explicit Laguerre kernel for Lamzouri's small-gap criterion

The integer polynomials share the scale 2^83 * 83!. They equal the
ordinary monomial expansions of the Gaussian–Laguerre pair in the
companion note SmallGapFourierCertificate.md after that rescaling.
Use the scale only when comparing unnormalized coefficients. It
cancels from the normalized physical and Fourier tests.
-/

